een appearances as oracle meyer  made a name for herself in the horror  genre  she played a prominent role in the saw  franchise as detective carrie  appearing in the series all the way up  until saw four other horror movies you  might have seen her in include piranha  3d  and the evil within no stranger to the  small screen  she also made an appearance in an  episode of american horror story  before she appeared in tabloids  alongside charlie sheen  denise richards played the role of  carmen evanez in starship troopers  while it was one of her first major film  roles it wouldn't be her last  not long after the movie came out she  co-starred in the successful and  notorious film  wild things and in 1999 richards was in  the james bond movie the world is not  enough  where she played a nuclear physicist  with a very memorable name  doctor jones christmas jones  and don't make any jokes i've heard them  all  i don't know any doctor jokes in 2000  richards met her future husband charlie  sheen on the set of good advice  the pair tied the knot in 2002 and they  would go on to appear together in the  2003 film scary movie 3.  after a rocky and very public  relationship richards and sheen divorced  in 2006.  through the years richards is kept  extremely busy appearing in films and tv  shows  since 2019 she's been a regular cast  member of the bold and the beautiful  and the real housewives of beverly hills  as the son of gary busey jake busey was  destined to become an actor  after many smaller roles his big break  came in 1997 when he starred in two  major sci-fi flicks  contact and starship troopers since that  time he's been working non-stop  appearing in a wide variety of tv shows  and films one of his most popular roles  came in 2014 when he landed a part in  from dusk till dawn the series  you've also likely seen him make brief  but memorable appearances in other tv  shows such as  agents of shield and stranger things  where his character morphed from  annoying to deadly  also in 2018 bucy followed in the  footsteps of his famous father  and appeared in a predator film while  michael ironside has been acting since  the 70s  many movie fans were first introduced to  him in starship troopers  he played lieutenant rajak the commander  of the bug crushing roughnecks and  johnny rico's old high school teacher  rochak was highly respected for his  combat skills  leadership qualities and keen  battlefield observations  [Music]  they sucked his brains out  since his time leading the roughnecks  ironside has portrayed an  endless array of tough guys including an  animated one  he voiced the character of darkseid on  superman the animated series  justice league and justice league  unlimited however you've still been  able to see his face on many occasions  he was the captain of the seventh fleet  in x-men first class and he's appeared  in the flash television series as louis  snart  the father of captain cold most recently  ironside had a major role as jp morgan  and the alienist  and like casper van dien he appeared in  an episode of hawaii 5.0  seth gilliam played the heroic sugar  watkins in starship troopers  a loyal member of the roughnecks who  gave his all to protect his comrades and  take out as many bugs as possible  after that role gilliam went on to star  in 17 episodes of the hit series  oz as clayton hughes it wouldn't be the  last time he would star in a prestigious  hbo series  you also likely recognize him as  sergeant ellis carver from the wire  however his most prominent role as of  late has been as gabriel stokes on the  walking dead  after being filled with regret over  those he didn't save from the zombie  outbreak  gabriel goes on to become one of rick  grimes most trusted allies in the fight  for peace  neil patrick harris was already a  recognizable star by 1997  thanks to his years playing the title  role in the hit series doogie howser md  in starship troopers however he was able  to show off a bit more of his 